---
description: Conventions for the FastAPI AI service and data scripts
globs: ["ai-service/**", "scripts/**"]
alwaysApply: false
---

- FastAPI with Pydantic models for every request/response body.
- pandas for the forecasting math; keep it in ai-service/forecasting/ as pure
  functions that take data in and return data out — no direct DB or HTTP calls
  inside the math functions, so they're independently testable.
- Type hints on every function signature.
- The recommendation engine must return ALL candidate options it considered,
  not just the chosen one — the dashboard needs to show the tradeoff.